window.products.push({"id":938118,"name":"Pure Argentino Ceramic Yerba Mate Tumbler Gourd of Diamond Facet Pattern, Bombilla NOT Included(Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NlH5AcXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CERAMIC GOURDS are naturally special - they embody all classical elements: water, fire, earth and wind to always deliver full complexity of taste of your drink in simplicity of the substance. Skillfully crafted in a closed tulip bud shape, the tumbler alike the flower will carefully keep the spirit of the contents inside and fill your heart with comfort, peace and joy. It is a practical, though traditional , alternative to the natural gourd. It assures pure savor of the drink, free of chemicals or oxidation, allows use of sour liquids, hot and cold, fizzy and still, with or without a bombilla; it does not retain or impart flavors - and, all in all, provides versatility and provokes multi-use. Functional, but dazzling – a surprising mix of qualities to boast for a gourd. The walls are diamond-like faceted and patinated with a rough brush-stroke to add luster and vintage look. This beautiful pattern is enclosed with a black glazed rim falling deep into the inside of the cup – a super-powerful effect, indeed. Durable and ergonomic. Due to the well-known super-insulating qualities of clay, it will never crack in a microwave, and never disturb your lips and hands with burn. Furthermore, no stress in taking care of the gourd is guaranteed. Just flick gently the dregs and rinse under a stream of water. The sensational clay is resistant to any detergents and washing liquids, but make sure you do not try too hard and use abrasives like metal brush. Little care is always good! At the same time, watch out and do not drop the tumbler - occasional clumsiness may not break it, but definitely result in nasty chips, which will disappoint its glamour. Be reassuringly free with this wonderful possession to drink mate or other infusions, socialize or meditate, travel or stay, and, or course, free to store little things of great value, or arrange your favorite flowers in it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NlH5AcXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Argentino","source_asin":"B07MD98HZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MD98HZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MD98HZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938119,"name":"9\"/10\"/11\"(3PCS) Nonstick Heavy Duty Bakeware Springform pans,Cake pans, Cheesecakes pans (Heart, Round, Square)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6146nYGen7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This springform pans makes it easy to create delicious cheesecakes, as well as other special desserts like layer cakes and tortes. The pan is made by special heavy duty carbon steel and characterized by high hardness and super endurance. Premium Whitford non-stick coating perfect demoulding. How to use - Wash before first use in warm. soapy water and dry thoroughly. - Metal and sharp kitchen tools should not be used as they may damage the non-stick coating. Wooden rubber heat-resistant nylon or plastic tools will be a good choice when baking. - Ensure product has cooled down around ten minutes prior to cleaning. - Never use heat above 450℉ and no any acidic food allowed when baking. - Do not place the product over direct heat or gas flame for a long time. Otherwise cake mold will be damaged. - Clean by dishwasher or hand washing with degertent. Do not use metal scourers or harsh abraasives to remove burnt-on food left in the pan. leave a soak for a few minutes in hot. Soapy water before starting to clean. Dry it by cloth or kitchen paper towel before storing. - This product is only suitable for oven. Please do not use it in microwave oven, electromagnetic oven or gas stove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6146nYGen7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMOW","source_asin":"B07CSZXHR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CSZXHR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CSZXHR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
