window.products.push({"id":938164,"name":"LOVEINUSA 34Pcs Mini Sisal Snow Frost Trees, Bottle Brush Trees 5 Sizes Christmas DIY Decoration Home Table Top Decoration Diorama Tree Models","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Nor-9CRVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDED - 34 × Mini bottle brush tree ( with 5 different sizes: 4.9\", 3.3\", 2.6\", 1.8\" and 1.4\" in height, can meet most of occasions) MULTIPLE SIZES - Our Bottle Brush Trees are designed with 5 different height ranging from 4.9\" to 1.5\", perfectly fit in different sizes of containers. Perfect decorations for Christmas, can add a strong holiday atmosphere to home. HIGH QUALITY - Our Bottle Christmas Tree is made up of sisal fibers, bendable wire and a wooden base, longlasting and durable, hardly broken, non-toxic and odorless, no color fading. REALISTIC - Our Bottle Brush Trees Christmas is inspired by the real one and duplicated with workmanship. You can't tell the differences between the real tree and ours except the size. The snow-like chippings on the tree add the natural atmosphere. WIDE APPLICATIONS - Suitable for DIY bottle scenes, schools' environmental projects, used as architecture teaching assistant tool and beautify your table, show window, holiday village, etc. Perfect for building models, sand table model, train model, toy model, scene layout, railway layout, outdoor landscape and christmas decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Nor-9CRVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVEINUSA","source_asin":"B0BQDF3JLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQDF3JLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQDF3JLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938165,"name":"Seattle Washington Skyline by Michael Tompsett, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sb6i4ER-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor skyline of Seattle, Washington. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sb6i4ER-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B017NGTZBI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NGTZBI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NGTZBI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
