window.products.push({"id":938317,"name":"Viking Authentic Medieval Inspired Natural Horn Tankard Handmade Drinking Mug 20 Oz (1 Pcs Only)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iBrg8nNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a unique and authentic way to enjoy your favorite drink? Look no further than our 16 oz natural horn Viking drinking mug with dire wolf engraved on it. Made from natural cow ox horn, each mug is handcrafted to perfection, ensuring that every mug has a unique shape, shade, and color. The dire wolf engraving adds an extra touch of authenticity, making this mug a perfect addition to any collection of Viking-inspired drinking vessels. Our Viking drinking mug is not only authentic but also food-grade safe. It is carefully treated with a non-toxic, long-lasting lacquer on the interior to ensure healthy drink quality. You can enjoy your favorite mead, ale, beer, or lager with the confidence that your drink is safe for consumption. The natural artistic design of our Viking drinking mug is simply stunning. Each individual cup boasts its own color striation, sleek finish, and shape because they’re all handmade to suit each aspiring warrior. The dire wolf engraving adds a touch of ferocity and ruggedness to the design, making it a perfect addition to any home bar or kitchen. Our Viking drinking mug is also a heroic gift choice. You can get one for yourself or give it as a gift to a friend or loved one who values beards, tattoos, swearing, axes, beer, ale, and wrestling bears bare-handed. Our Viking horn mug is a perfect gift choice for any occasion, whether it’s for a birthday, anniversary, or any other special event. With a large capacity of 16 oz., our Viking drinking mug can hold a generous amount of your favorite drink. You can enjoy your drink without having to refill it multiple times. Plus, when you’re done drinking, you can slam it down like a real Norse God. We stand by the quality of our products and offer a satisfaction guarantee. If you experience any issues or concerns with your Viking drinking mug, please do not hesitate to contact our customer service team. We will work with you to resolve any issues or concerns you may have.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iBrg8nNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REPLICARTZ","source_asin":"B07N63XWJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N63XWJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N63XWJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
