window.products.push({"id":938337,"name":"Espresso Machine Latte Makers 20 Bar Cappuccino Machines with Milk Frother for Espresso/Cappuccino/Latte/Mocha for Home Brewing with 35 oz Removable W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Hjj3EXXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【20 BAR PERFECT ESPRESSO CREMA EXTRACTION】 - JASSY 20 Bar Espresso Machine is is equipped with 20 bar professional pump and 1450W powerful motor.Which ensure rich tasting extraction from coffee bean.All the flavors are drawn out evenly during the extraction ☕【POWERFUL MILK FOAMING】 - Professional frothing milk for cappccino and latte by hot stram wand. It's convenient to adjust the stainless steam wand by rotating the side button,which release hot steam or hot water to provide silk and smooth foaming for milk to make cappuccino/latte drinks just like in coffee shop ☕【HOT WATER FUNCTION】 - Our machines provide hot water function, which can be used to warm and wash cups. At the same time, the hot water function makes it easier to clean the milk frother ☕【SINGLE/DOUBLE CUP FUNCTION】- The JASSY espresso maker comes with the 2 in 1 portafilter with two filters - single and double to brew one or two espresso shots automatically just at press the single or double button on the panel. ☕【STAINLESS STEEL BODY MATERIAL】- Built with 304 stainless steel material keep the espresso coffee machine in longer lifespan.And stainless steel body also been clean in easy way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Hjj3EXXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JASSY","source_asin":"B0C8CYFVTT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8CYFVTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8CYFVTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938338,"name":"DecoRaum Bathroom Accessories Set, 6 Pcs Plastic Bathroom Set, Toothbrush Holder, Bathroom Tumbler, Soap Dispenser, Soap Dish, Trash Can, Toilet Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51foL+fGF1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product advantages:  1. Air-dried Quickly and Convenient to Clean 2. plastic with soft touch finish 3. Durable and non-slip design 4. Our Functional bathroom accessories set makes life easier, and the overall color scheme makes your bathroom look cleaner 5. Beautiful modern design can elegantly blend into any bathroom setting    6PCS Bathroom Accessory Set includes: Bathroom Tumbler: 2.8”x2.8”x5.1” Soap dispenser: 2.8”x2.8”x7” Soap dish: 5”x4.8”x1.2” Toothbrush holder: 2.8”x2.8”x5.3” Toilet brush holder: 3”x3”x15” Trash can: 7.1”x7.1”x12.2”     Notice: 1. Due to the light and screen difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. 2. Please allow 1-3mm difference due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51foL+fGF1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DecoRaum","source_asin":"B08WRC9VM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WRC9VM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WRC9VM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938339,"name":"Cup of Life by Bonnie Mohr 16x22 Coffee Java Inspirational Framed Art Print Wall Décor Picture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7181EbQkJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"I took a sip - and then another. It was perfect! The flavor was as delicious as the aroma. I sat back and relaxed, enjoying the fullness of what was in my cup. Gazing around the room, I noticed that people were drinking from a wide variety of cups. They ranged from ceramic to stoneware; from insulated to extra tall. Some were unusual; even extravagant. I also saw cups that were very expensive - plain and ordinary, some had a chip or a crack. Regardless of the cup, however, I noticed that everyone was fully engaged, enjoying their indulgence! AND SO IT IS WITH LIFE...The beverage in our cup represents our life, and the quality of it. We hope that it is full of love, happiness, and an abundance of blessings. The cup represents everything else that sustains our journey through life; including our house, our job and our car. The cup does not define or change the quality of what's inside. It is not the expense or beauty of a cup that really matters, but rather, the enjoyment we receive, from what it holds. AND SO IT IS WITH LIFE...Happiness doesn't hinge on having the biggest, the best, or the most; it is a decision to live each day to the fullest, enjoying what we have, regardless of our cup. God has prepared a beverage especially for you. Embrace your life, and most of all remember...'Life is not about your cup, but seriously - what's inside it.' Bonnie Mohr","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7181EbQkJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Cabin Décor","source_asin":"B00N5712Y8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N5712Y8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N5712Y8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
