window.products.push({"id":938440,"name":"CBI Pipe & Supply Tool Division Pipe Fence Weldable Saddle Cap - Versatile & Durable Solution for Pipe Fencing Applications - Saddle Cap Designed to F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fQ+fN4o4L.jpg","description":"The quality division welding pipe cap is a specialized tool designed for use in steel pipe fencing applications. This tool is made from high-quality steel and is designed to be both durable and long-lasting. One of the key benefits of using this saddle cap is that it eliminates the need to use a cutting torch to cut saddles, making it a much safer and more efficient option for fence installation, designed to fit pipes ranging from 2 3/8\" to 2 7/8\". Ideal for Pipe Fencing Applications The pipe fence weldable saddle cap is an ideal solution for various pipe fencing applications, including agricultural, residential, and commercial. It can be used to secure and stabilize horizontal pipes, as well as to provide a secure attachment point for fencing materials. Versatile and Durable Solution The horizontal saddle caps are made from high-quality materials that make it a durable solution for pipe fencing applications. It is designed to withstand in any environmental conditions and provide permanent performance. It helps to secure and stabilize horizontal pipes, providing a secure environment for workers and minimizing the risk of property damage. Reliable Fencing System The saddle cap is engineered for easy and reliable installation onto the pipe. Its forged weldable steel design ensures a strong and secure attachment, minimizing the risk of slippage or detachment that could compromise the integrity of the fencing system. With this reliable installation, users can have peace of mind that their fence will withstand the elements and provide everlasting performance. Weldable Saddle Cap The CBI Pipe & Supply tool division pipe fence weldable cap is designed to be welded onto the top of a pipe, creating a saddle-like shape that can be used to attach fencing materials to the pipe. This makes it a practical choice for a variety of pipe fencing applications, such as ranches, farms, and industrial sites.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fQ+fN4o4L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CBI Pipe","source_asin":"B07MHGC287","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MHGC287","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MHGC287","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938441,"name":"Throw Blanket for Couch and Sofa - 50x60 Soft Cozy Knit Throw Blanket with Tassels, Warm Solid and Textured Woven Blanket, All Season Lightweight Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1uquF4wPpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Quality You Can Always Count On - When We Started. Being centered in a town famous for its knitting, we have been there manufacturing and designing knitting products such as scarfs, hats, throw blankets of different materials, and designs for almost 10 years. Attention to every single detail of our products is always paid to what material to be used; what patterns/styles to fit the products most and what aesthetic color combinations to choose. We have been conducting customer research to make our products better and better, and thank you all! What Sizes to Choose? For beds that are 60\" in width, we'd suggest you go for the 50\"x60\" with the color you like most; For beds 70\"- 80\" in width, choose the 60\"x80\" instead Skin-Friendly Safe Material Super soft and breathable acrylic material that's 100% friendly to babies' tender skin and expectant mothers. Recycling Tips For throw blankets that have been used for quite a long time (in used condition but it still does its job well), please donate them to animal shelters. Let us do what we can to make homeless kitties and dogs live better, we thank you in advance! For any concerns about our products, please get back to us as we are ready anytime to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1uquF4wPpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedeco","source_asin":"B08PCYS2R2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PCYS2R2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PCYS2R2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
