window.products.push({"id":938554,"name":"Enesco Disney Traditions by Jim Shore Lion King Scar Villain Figurine, 7 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GtNNTQbCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's best to be prepared when this darkly ambitious predator has his power-hungry eyes on the throne! Reimagined in Jim Shore's traditional folk art pattern and motifs, Scar sings proudly of his villainous plot to steal the crown with details of his laughing, hyena henchmen decorating his pelt. With one paw perched on the rocks in front of him, Scar pompously preens with a maniacal grin as he imagines victoriously overthrowing his family. This cunning villain makes a bold, delightfully devious statement to any collection, and an amazing gift for any \"Lion King\" fan. About us: Enesco is committed to bring joy every day. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Things Remembered, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GtNNTQbCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B07DR3Y17T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DR3Y17T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DR3Y17T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
