window.products.push({"id":938602,"name":"Sondiko Oval Bread Proofing Basket, Handmade Banneton Bread Proofing Basket Brotform with Proofing Cloth Liner for Sourdough Bread, Baking(9.6 x 6 x 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZLokLx6OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rattan 🍒►【Excellent Craftsmanship, Sondiko Brand】This oval banneton basket using natural rattan, absolutely free from dyeing agent&chemicals. Made with natural material, love and care from our making handmade basket masters. Comply with EU food standard. 🍒►Good Bread Hygiene&Easy Cleaning - Compare to the bread from the Store which is filled with artificial flavors and chemicals, your homemade bread can keep all the whole essence of wheat. Clean by hand wash with warm water within 2 minutes and keep dry after clean, or leave somewhere warm and dry. 🍒►Good Gift Choice for Professional&Home Bakers - Comes with Bread proofing basket, liner cloth. If you too have that one friend who loves handmade bread, then the sourdough starter kit is a great gift for them! Let your family and friends enjoy the art of creating a delicious and healthy bread that you can share. 🍒►Perfect Size for Baking Bread - Holds 1.5 pounds of dough with 9.6 x 6 x 3 inches size bread basket. Great baking bread making proofing baskets, bread proofing basket set for sourdough bread. TIPS: This bread basket has a special botanical aroma 🍒►100% WARRANTY & BEST SERVICE - Sondiko sourdough basket adopt high quality rattan from Indonesia. Besides, we spare no effort to provide the best service for all of our customers, making sure each of you have a great experience with Sondiko on Amazon! If you are not satisfied with the bread proofing basket, contact us with in 60 days for a hassle-free full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZLokLx6OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sondiko","source_asin":"B07Q4T48V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q4T48V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q4T48V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938603,"name":"Ovente Portable Electric Hand Mixer 5 Speed Mixing, 150W Powerful Blender for Baking & Cooking with 2 Stainless Steel Chrome Beater Attachments & Snap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LEiQxVo6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"What’s a kitchen without a great hand mixer? A hand mixer is ideal for people who love cooking, but it’s ESPECIALLY USEFUL for those with a passion for baking. The hand mixer makes baking so much easier and more enjoyable by mixing even the heaviest food ingredients together without it feeling like a chore. It even cuts prep time in half, so you have more time to do what you love. Like most kitchen appliances, the mixer is made to save time and effort that you put into cooking and baking. A kitchen without a mixer is incomplete, because this appliance has so many benefits and helps tremendously with food prep by making it 10x easier! Grabbing the best hand mixer available in the market is not about how expensive it is. It’s more about quality, longevity, and most of all—what it can DO for YOU.  The Ovente HM161 Hand Mixer features a speed selector switch with 5 mixing speeds that you can change depending on your chosen recipe. Now, no dessert will ever be out of reach because it can handle even the heaviest mixtures with its powerful 150-watt motor! Its 2 chrome beaters can easily be removed by pushing the beater eject button, which allows for quick and safe removal.  The ergonomic shape of this hand mixer makes it comfortable and easy to hold, so baking never feels like work. Once you’re done using your hand mixer, wash it by placing it in your dishwasher or handwashing it yourself. Once everything is dry, you can keep all of its accessories together inside its snap-on storage container, which helps you stay organized while saving cabinet space! Effective and efficient, isn’t it?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LEiQxVo6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B0849QL7MF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0849QL7MF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0849QL7MF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
