window.products.push({"id":938741,"name":"Gender Reveal Party Photobooth Props - 20 Piece Baby Gender Reveal Party Supplies Set - Perfect Decorations For Baby Shower Photo Booth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JFuN7jbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get ready for your big gender reveal party with these super cute and funny photo booth props! A fun little DIY project that brings your photos to life - let your friends, family and guests make their picks on whether it's a boy or a girl and then get the photos to prove it before you do the big reveal! The Accessory You're Forgetting ,br> You've got your centerpieces, confetti, ribbons, balloons, plates, favors, straws, activities, and everything fits the theme! But don't forget the classic pink vs. blue vote for your gender reveal - and these photo props will help take your party to the next level so there are plenty of selfies and photo ops to go around! Full Prop Set,br>Each prop varies in size, meaning that the pacifier is about the size of a pacifier so it's the smallest of the bunch. The set also includes rattles, signs for mom & dad, mustaches and more! For specific sizes, check out the measurements in our pictures above. Plenty of fun and creative ideas on how to make use of these props!Everything You Need Is In This Kit!,br> The kit includes everything you need - 20 high quality paper signs with 20 wooden sticks along with the adhesive strips to attach/assemble the signs before your party. Set these props out before your party and just watch how much fun your guests have with them! In addition to the essentials, we've even got some fun signs for the people who were dragged to the party by their wife (you know who you are). This set of props will take your party to a whole other level (and it's a whole lot easier than making them from scratch).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JFuN7jbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Party Prop Supply","source_asin":"B01J4CRRXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J4CRRXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J4CRRXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
