window.products.push({"id":938809,"name":"Tangkula TV Stand, Modern Design Wooden Storage Console Entertainment Center for TV up to 58\", Home Living Room Furniture with 4 Open Storage Shelves,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31N1Kw9hY6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description： Crafted with good-quality MDF and PB materials, this TV stand console can meet your various needs. It means that if you are finding a practical and beautiful for your living room, it will be a good choice. Looking at the thicken legs, which are properly set in best place to support the frame of this TV stand . Also the stand tabletop is flat enough, adding 4 shelves, to hold many audio video equipment or other sundries. And don’t worry about overheat of devices, the cable management system: 4 cut-offs and the 4 open shelves, will help them ventilating.The classic appearance and wood color also fit with modern atmosphere, even it can upgrade the level of your living room or recreation room. So don’t hesitate to buy it. Features: Constructed from high-grade MDF, TV stand storage console is durable and sturdy. Measuring 58\"long, nicely accommodates almost any flat panel 60\" TV 4 open shelves, store books, magazines, home theater system and other media or gaming devices 4 simple yet practical cables cut outs in each shelf for easy wire feeding and ventilation of audio video equipment With fixing strap,prevent tv stand from falling down Open design keeps your devices from overheating Wood grain and simple lines, classic and elegant Weight capacity is up to 250 lbs Non-slip mat on the bottom of legs, protect floor from scratching Coordinating easily with surrounding decor, ideal for your bedroom, recreation room, or den Easy to clean with smooth surface Easy to assemble by following instruction Specification： Materials: PB+MDF Color: wood grain Product dimension: 58\" × 16\" ×24\"(W×D×H) Net weight: 61.5 lbs Weight capacity: 150lbs PB Board Thickness: 0.5\" MDF Back Board Thickness: 0.1\" Package includes: 1× TV stand 1× instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31N1Kw9hY6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B07CP6GQR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CP6GQR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CP6GQR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938810,"name":"Yumware Heat Resistant Barbecue Oven Gloves - Withstands Heat up to 932°f - Thick but Light-Weight & Flexible - 3 Different Sizes - Gift Box Packaging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g10X5t1DL._AC_.jpg","description":"<b>THE BEST OVEN GLOVES FOR YOU:</b> Yumware is the #1 name you can trust. These oven gloves offer you premium protection while handling hot utensils, pots and pans in the oven, microwave or on the stove top. Try them outdoors; they make ideal BBQ gloves for your barbecue or BBQ smoker. These gloves are even fantastic to have at your fireplace, campfire,changing hot light bulbs, handling hot irons, etc. - more flexible than traditional oven mittens, silicone gloves and any pot holders <b>THE PREMIER WAY TO SAFELY PROTECT YOUR HANDS:</b> Yumware() oven grill gloves are a true innovation in heat protection. Your new extreme heat resistant gloves use only the best quality firefighter materials. EN407 Certified, these gloves utilize the powerhouse combination of Meta-Aramid & Para-Aramid which compare with Kevlar and Nomex to create the next generation of extreme heat safety. You'll be fully protected up to 932F! <b>VERY COMFORTABLE, EASY TO USE & TO CLEAN:</b> Our outstanding cooking gloves have a 100% cotton lining for comfort flexible and fluid thumbs & fingers. They are easy to slide on and easy to slide off. Machine washable so cleaning these gloves is super easy Don't waste time on low quality mitts that stain, burn, and just don't offer the protection you deserve! Instead stay cool and safe with your new Yumware Oven Gloves with strong silicone design for a no slip grip <b>TOP GIFT IDEA:</b> Adorned with a beautiful and eye catching design, arriving in a gorgeous gift box, this pair of gloves will enhance anyone's kitchen or outdoor grilling set. They make the perfect gift for birthday, holiday, or just anytime! Give it to someone to show you appreciate or care about them. They'll love you for it! Comes in 3 different sizes and 2 different colors: Small/Medium, Large & Extra Large; Purple & Off White, Pink & Green, so we have just the right one for you! <b>ORDER WORRY FREE:</b> Yumware OFFERS A 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE & A FREE, NO HASSLE, REPLACEMENT WARRANTY! Not to mention our world class customer service that's ready and available to address your concerns no matter when you may need it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g10X5t1DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yumware","source_asin":"B01A1L8J1E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A1L8J1E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A1L8J1E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
