window.products.push({"id":938821,"name":"Office Chair,Reclining High Back Desk Chair,Ergonomic Home Mesh Chair,Tilt and Lock,Computer Swivel Task Chair with Lumbar Support Pillow,Adjustable H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCJXbgFvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recline & Lock Function - The backrest can be tilted back and recline range is from 90 to 135 degree. Plus, you can recline and lock that position at any angle within that range, which helps relieve stress on the lower back muscles and relax the lumbar area, allowing you to relax from heavy work. Adjustable Headrest & Retractable Footrest- Headrest with adjustable height and angle, easy to adjust to meet different needs. The retractable soft-padded footrest sits just under the seat, which adds to the overall comfort of the chair.It is perfect for the office, bedroom, study room, conference room, reception room, and gaming room. Ergonomic Lumbar Support - The mesh backrest, made of porous material, offers you a breathable feel. The sturdy backrest frame supports the natural curve of the spine, allowing you to maintain a good sitting posture. Besides, the soft lumbar support pillow relieves the pressure on the lower back, bringing you the ultimate comfort. Comfortable Seat & Padded Armrests - The seat cushion is made of high-quality foam and fabric. It’s firm yet soft enough to prevent excessive stress placed on your pelvis and comfortable enough to support your sitting for prolonged periods of time. The padded armrests help reduce the tension in the upper body and allow the shoulders and arms to relax. Smooth Movement & Stability - Our comfy office chair comes with smooth, multi-direction casters, which allow you to move the chair around with zero effort. It could run smoothly on tile, wooden floors, carpets, and other floorings. The large 5-star base increases stability even at the full height range. The maximum weight capacity is 275 lbs. Rest Assured to Purchase: We provide you with the installation manual in the package. The instruction is very simple to follow, with no extra tools and fittings needed. We have a professional customer service team and if you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCJXbgFvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMUG","source_asin":"B0BPH3YF9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPH3YF9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPH3YF9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
