window.products.push({"id":938856,"name":"Tiger Abstract Tempered Glass Wall Art Frameless Modern Contemporary Large Decor Floating Glass Printing For Your Home Living Room Bedroom Or Office W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-2+pKCQFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What does Tempered Glass Wall Art mean?Well, tempered glass is used in many areas, like car windows or glass doors. Using Tempered Glass to print an image behind it and hang it on your wall is just a new way of displaying Art. It replaced the very costly face mounting applications and makes this type of Wall Art affordable for everyone.How does it look?Just imagine an HDTV displaying your artwork on your wall.Is it easy to clean? Yes, very easy. The image is printed behind the glass. So the front of the artwork is like regular glass, a normal cloth, and some Windex will do the trick.How should I handle tempered glass?It is very difficult to break tempered glass from the front or backside. The corners and edges are vulnerable. When you need to remove your tempered glass wall art, place it flat on its front on a cloth.Welcome to Art360. We are Wall Art Producers and sellers since a decade. We started out with canvas prints and now the new trend is tempered glass.  Art Prints behind tempered glass have a unique look that compares to no other. That is why the majority of our sales of last year have been tempered glass prints. We have delivered more than 3000 pieces to our customers in the US within the last 10 months so far. We print behind 4 mm (6th of an inch) thick tempered glass. The image is then covered with a white resin to protect the colors and a hanger is glued behind it. Due to our bad experience with cardboard, we choose to protect our delivery with MDF sheets front and back which then is wrapped in plastic foil, then taped, labeled, and express shipped.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-2+pKCQFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BHTV792F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHTV792F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHTV792F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
