window.products.push({"id":938869,"name":"8ft. Slim White Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights and 1348 Bendable Branches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":185.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqGAnAxHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you dreaming of a white Christmas? Fulfill all your dreams with this white artificial Christmas tree. Inspired by nature, this tree has a slim silhouette that mimics its real counterparts' natural foliage and texture. With 1348 bendable branches, you can easily display all your favorite ornaments. Save time and money with the pre-strung 400 lights. Standing 8ft. from a metal stand, curate in any area. Perfect for a family room, living room, or home office. Faux Christmas Trees are manufactured using synthetic materials, such as polyester material or plastic, and are well designed and constructed to be life-like in appearance. This item will need to be re-shaped when removed from the secure box to allow it to reach its fullest size. Your artificial Christmas Tree will look beautiful for years to come; simply wipe clean with a soft dry cloth when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xqGAnAxHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nearly Natural","source_asin":"B0C3JNHWVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3JNHWVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3JNHWVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938870,"name":"Yosemite Home Decor Vanishing Into The Distance, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.22,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gt3nvfLIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DCA091 is impressionist landscape painting, presenting Railway in nature, heading toward North, toward horizon. Symbolically, one can say that painting DCA091 presents course of ones life and fact that we are inevitably approaching new stages and events in life, just over the horizon. Painting possesses intricate depth and layers thanks to smart and inspired brush strokes and color application over the painting, in the process of landscape creation. On DCA091 painter has presented rich and peaceful tones of fall sunset. Painting is lush in shades of fall gold, contrasted with cobalt shades of sky in dusk. Landscape on the DCA091 painting is peaceful and Calm, enabling observer to engage in introspective thinking while looking at it. When you look at this serene landscape and railroad that leads to eternity, it will seem inevitable to engage into some in-depth observation or retrospective contemplation. Painting is very realistically presenting all the details in landscape, grabbing observers attention with focused exposition of individual items such as pebbles between railroad tracks, shade cast toward railroad from nearby Golden trees that seem like they are trembling on easy sunset breeze. Shades of sunset are in particularly dazzling way presented on the sky that is not just darkening blue, but there are also golden-orange hues of sun sliding behind the horizon that embraces both the sun and railroad. This work of art is hand painted on a gallery wrapped canvas and signed by the artist ensuring each piece has some subtle differences making it distinctly unique to each owner. The high quality canvas wraps tightly around a sturdy wooden frame that will last for years to come. The painting comes with either a pre-strewn wire or hinges on the back so that its ready for immediate wall mounting. The light weight of the piece allows for easy hanging without worry of damaging your wall. The acrylic paint creates a rich texture that will really catch the light, creating a very sophisticated allure. Each painting is carefully packaged and inspected prior to shipping, ensuring every piece Arrives safely and ready to hang on your wall, making for a pleasant purchasing experience from beginning to end.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gt3nvfLIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yosemite Home Decor","source_asin":"B00ESLQYSO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ESLQYSO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ESLQYSO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938871,"name":"Yimi's Dream Foldable Storage Basket, [3-Pack] Storage Bin for Gifts Empty, Fabric Storage Baskets for Shelves with Handles, Pink Storage Bins for Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ne1A47qKS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ORGANIZATIONAL SOLUTION FOR THE HOME: The Yimi's Dream storage bin provides a solution to many storage needs, this is an easy way for you to pick up and maintain organization! Baskets can be used as gift baskets for families, toy storage, laundry basket, blanket basket, clothing storage, or storage baskets for shelves BOTH FUNCTIONAL & STYLISH: These organizers and storage are available in classic styles and colors, a perfect addition to a bedroom, living room, study room, restroom, kitchen, office, closets, and cabinets, or to add a splash of color to any room while also being functional MATERIAL SUMMARY: The fabric storage basket is made of three layers of high-quality materials. The innermost is lined with hygienic materials. The middle layer is made of eco-friendly EVA to keep the storage basket strong. The outermost has a linen-like design, beautiful and generous. Reinforced by an upper supporting frame, two sturdy handles on both sides for easy carrying SPACE-SAVING & CONVENIENCE: The collapsible function allows you to save space when not in use and provides convenience for carrying around, and even you can use it when you go for an outdoor picnic. Folding may cause wrinkles, but don't worry, you can use a steam iron to speed up the smoothing TIPS: The basket storage is not recommended to be machine washed because they have a frame inside. But it is easy to clean which is recommended to use a soft cloth to wipe, if necessary, wash it off with light soapy water. If you encounter any problems, please contact us through Amazon, we will reply to you within 24 hours and provide you with satisfactory customer service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ne1A47qKS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yimi's Dream","source_asin":"B0BZPMZH1B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZPMZH1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZPMZH1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938872,"name":"SAMSUNG Jet Bot AI+ Robot Vacuum Cleaner w/Object Recognition, Intelligent Cleaning, Clean Station, 5-Layer Filter, Touchless Dust Removal for Hardwoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":724.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RKlVS32PS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The new Samsung Jet Bot AI+ Robot Vacuum Cleaner & Clean Station had LiDAR sensors, a 3D Camera, and advanced AI Object Recognition technology, which identifies and avoids objects in your home. It adjusts to multiple floor surfaces, such as hard wood and carpet, for an optimized clean. Monitor your home through a live video stream to your mobile phone with Jet Live Home Monitoring, and use the no-touch, hygienic Clean Station to automatically empty the dustbin. Comprehensive 5-layer HEPA filtration system traps up to 99.99% of dust. Jet Bot AI+ identifies the type of floor surface and power needed to clean thoroughly and deeper into carpets with power control technology. Select where the cordless vacuum should or should not clean right from your mobile device. Jet Bot recognizes rooms and cleans areas selectively based on your preferences. Check Jet Bot’s status using the SmartThings App. Quickly view movement on a map of your home from wherever you are and see where it has cleaned, instruct it to pause or stop, and view the cleaning history. The 0.25 liter dustbin is fully washable. Its high-efficiency brush has fine, anti-static fibers and self-cleaning extractors to avoid tangles. Clean your home using voice recogntion, compatible with Bixby, Google Assistant, and Amazon Alexa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RKlVS32PS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B0912TLG7T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912TLG7T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912TLG7T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":938873,"name":"Cybrtrayd 45St50-B039 Baby's 1st Birthday Lolly Chocolate Candy Mold with 50 Cybrtrayd 4.5\" Lollipop Sticks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kyWILcEzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques. To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision. Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kyWILcEzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B00EU5A2NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EU5A2NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EU5A2NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
