window.products.push({"id":938890,"name":"Tealight Candle Holder Set of 2, Hand Painted Floral Design Home Décor Accent Gift for Table, Fireplace, Living Room, Office or Ethnic Restaurant, Sce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zmeKmWujL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Once you take these ethnic art items s to your hands, you wouldn't want to give them away! They are so beautiful! These unique hand painted tea candle holders come to you from the heart of Europe - Central Ukraine. They are professionally painted in an original Ukrainian manner named \"Petrykivka\". Petrykivka decorative painting is a phenomenon of the Ukrainian ornamental folk art, which dates back to the 17th century. This technique is the finest example of unique Slavic art culture, creating an emotional reflection of the communion of humans and nature. Petrykivka painting combines a plentitude of plant ornaments, particularly flowers, with elements of a fantasy fauna (firebirds, phoenix or roosters) and mirrors the unity of physically real nature with the spiritual world, the idea of recurrence of life and endless rebirth. The United Nations recognized this manner of hand painting as a unique form of intangible traditional practices of European culture. Each candle holder requires four coats of lacquer finish, which gives it a deluxe glossy surface. Lightly scented tea candle included. This original tea candle holders set will definitely become an elegant Easter gift for your loved ones!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zmeKmWujL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UA Creations","source_asin":"B076Z3LV3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-938890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076Z3LV3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076Z3LV3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
